<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">The Standing Rule of This Site</p>
    <h2 id="t-earned-chosen-refused">Earned, Chosen, Refused</h2>
    <p>Every research document identifies <em>what is earned and what is chosen</em>.
      <strong>Earned</strong> means a result follows by argument, arithmetic or observation and can be checked.
      <strong>Chosen</strong> means an interpretation is laid over that result &mdash; coherent, but not forced.
      <strong>Refused</strong> means a dramatic option was available and omitted because it added costume rather
      than explanatory structure.</p>
    <p class="muted">The framework is stronger for saying which is which. A reader who cannot tell the
      theorem from the vision has not been given the work; they have been given a mood.</p>
  </div>
</section>
